        all 12 call sites are changeInterestRate on an existing schedule model [VERIFIED: ProgressiveEMICalculatorTest.java:410, 459, 505, 549, 1725, 1726, 1770, 1771, 1772, 1773, 1814, 1815 — grep over the in-seam test tree returns exactly these 12, and every one is emiCalculator.changeInterestRate(model, date, value)]. The seam is structurally incapable of the origination form: LoanRepaymentScheduleModelData carries ONE scalar annualNominalInterestRate and no rate schedule at all [VERIFIED: LoanRepaymentScheduleModelData.java:32-39, the record header, 19 components]. Raised as T17 follow-up F4 against docs/analysis/tier0-vector-capture-plan.md section 3.4.

